TEXT 80 -96 Left 3 ;#155 Automatic dual-range analog voltmeter
TEXT 80 -32 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7OLGswQ7ICI&t=180s
TEXT 80 16 Left 2 ;LM10 reference controls a 2N7000 meter shunt; the measured supply powers the circuit.
TEXT 80 624 Left 2 !.lib LTC.lib
TEXT 80 656 Left 2 !.lib standard.dio
TEXT 80 688 Left 2 !.include ..\..\LTspice\Models\onsemi\2N7000.REV0.LIB
TEXT 80 720 Left 2 !.param R_METER_INTERNAL=3k
TEXT 80 752 Left 2 !.dc VTEST 0 30 0.1
TEXT 80 784 Left 2 !.meas dc I_AT_5V FIND I(RMETER) AT=5
TEXT 80 816 Left 2 !.meas dc I_AT_25V FIND I(RMETER) AT=25
TEXT 700 784 Left 2 !.meas dc VSWITCH WHEN V(GATE)=2.5 RISE=1
TEXT 700 816 Left 2 !.meas dc I_AT_30V FIND I(RMETER) AT=30
TEXT 80 864 Left 2 ;The 3k meter resistance is an explicit illustrative assumption; Alan specifies only 100uA full scale.
TEXT 80 896 Left 2 ;Alan marks 47k and 1k for calibration to the actual meter. The 5.1V zener and LED models are representative parts.
